      "answer": "YES",
      "assessment": "Meets both-passes requirement: enforce every program-carried conjunct there, and enforce policy subjectEnumeration kind in the preceding policy pass. compile_plan_policy/admit_from compile directly; inspect_policy_program verifies RULE_PROGRAM_COMPILATION_JOIN. Do not infer symbol from imports or reject absent program kind."
    },
    "2": {
